## Common Tasks

### Run Report from Code

```xpp
Args args = new Args();
AVASalesInvoiceReportController::main(args);
```

### Run Report with Parameters

```xpp
Args args = new Args();
AVASalesInvoiceReportController controller = new AVASalesInvoiceReportController();
AVASalesInvoiceReportContract contract;

controller.parmArgs(args);
contract = controller.parmReportContract().parmRdpContract() as AVASalesInvoiceReportContract;

// Set parameters
contract.parmCustAccount("US-001");
contract.parmDeliveryDateFrom(str2Date("01/01/2024", 123));
contract.parmDeliveryDateTo(str2Date("12/31/2024", 123));

controller.startOperation();
```

### Modify Query Programmatically

```xpp
Query query = new Query(queryStr(AVASalesInvoiceReportQuery));
QueryBuildDataSource qbdsSalesTable = query.dataSourceTable(tableNum(SalesTable));
QueryBuildRange qbrCustAccount = qbdsSalesTable.addRange(fieldNum(SalesTable, CustAccount));
qbrCustAccount.value("US-001");
```

