## Troubleshooting

| Issue | Solution |
|-------|----------|
| Report not in menu | Check security privileges |
| No data shown | Verify filters and test data exists |
| Query not found | Rebuild project and sync database |
| Parameter dialog doesn't show | Verify menu item points to controller class |
| Date validation fails | Check DeliveryDateFrom <= DeliveryDateTo |
| Performance issues | Review indexes and date range |

